"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1665,"Narrated to us by Bundar, narrated to us by Yahya, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, who said: 'A'ata informed me, from Jabir ibn Abdullah, from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said: ""Whoever eats from this tree, garlic, and then afterward [eats] onions or leeks, let him not approach our mosque, for the angels are harmed by what harms the human being."""
